<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Aug 29.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Aug 29.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Egyptian President Mubarak sends message to President Ben Ali on Middle East peace process.</p>
<p>- Beef prices slightly up because of ban on imported beef.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisia needs 800 telecommunications engineers during the next five years.</p>
</text>
